        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur DECSWPLTT1, Deco Light Switch Cover Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deco Single Light Switch Cover has a stepped design that is reminiscent of 1920's decor. It is available in an array of classic finishes for an authentic look. Switch plates are so often overlooked when designing the interior of a home. It's easy to go out and get the cheep plastic ones that discolor and look tacky; but every interior designer knows, it's the finishing details that really bring a room together. This solid brass Deco Light Switch Cover Plate is the perfect finishing touch for any mid-century modern home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Deco Toggle Switch Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
